cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CLARION or refer to this dissertation, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CLARION — Explainable Financial Alerts for Retail Investors"
abstract: >-
  An explainable (XAI-first) financial-alert system for retail investors in the US
  market. It detects abrupt market moves as statistical anomalies (rolling z-score,
  no lookahead) and matches new financial news to analogous historical cases
  (sentence-embedding retrieval) to show their observed event-study impact — as
  evidence, never a price prediction. Accompanies the MEIA (ISEP) master's dissertation.
